# Dragon Magazine Compendium - alternative class features for classes of Complete Warrior (loaded only with it; acf_build.py).

Aligned Spellcaster	KEY:Hexblade ACF ~ Aligned Spellcaster (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.HexbladeACF.HexbladeFamiliar	PRECLASS:1,Hexblade=4	PREALIGN:LG,LN,LE,NG,NE,CG,CN,CE	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Hexblade Aligned Spellcaster (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.563	DESC:Alternative class feature (hexblade, 4th level). Choose a non-neutral alignment component you have: your spells gain that alignment descriptor unless they already have the opposite one (a neutral good caster casts all non-evil spells as good spells). Spells you cast that target creatures of the opposite alignment are cast at +1 caster level (+2 against creatures with the opposite alignment as a subtype); area and other untargeted spells gain no bonus. A true neutral caster cannot take it. (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.
Aligned Spellcaster	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Aligned Spellcaster (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Hexblade Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.563	DESC:Choose a non-neutral alignment component you have: your spells gain that alignment descriptor unless they already have the opposite one (a neutral good caster casts all non-evil spells as good spells). Spells you cast that target creatures of the opposite alignment are cast at +1 caster level (+2 against creatures with the opposite alignment as a subtype); area and other untargeted spells gain no bonus. A true neutral caster cannot take it. (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.
Arcane Reabsorption	KEY:Hexblade ACF ~ Arcane Reabsorption (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.HexbladeACF.HexbladeFamiliar	PRECLASS:1,Hexblade=4	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Hexblade Arcane Reabsorption (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.563	DESC:Alternative class feature (hexblade, 4th level). Whenever a targeted spell you cast fails to penetrate a creature's spell resistance or is countered, and has no effect at all, you can attempt to reabsorb it as an immediate action: a Spellcraft check (DC 20 + 3 x spell level) regains the spell or spell slot as if never cast; either way you take 1 point of nonlethal damage per spell level, bypassing damage reduction and resistances. (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.
Arcane Reabsorption	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Arcane Reabsorption (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Hexblade Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.563	DESC:Whenever a targeted spell you cast fails to penetrate a creature's spell resistance or is countered, and has no effect at all, you can attempt to reabsorb it as an immediate action: a Spellcraft check (DC 20 + 3 x spell level) regains the spell or spell slot as if never cast; either way you take 1 point of nonlethal damage per spell level, bypassing damage reduction and resistances. (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.
Beleaguered Spellcaster	KEY:Hexblade ACF ~ Beleaguered Spellcaster (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.HexbladeACF.HexbladeFamiliar	PRECLASS:1,Hexblade=4	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Hexblade Beleaguered Spellcaster (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.564	DESC:Alternative class feature (hexblade, 4th level). Whenever you take damage equal to 3 x your spellcaster level (%1) from one attack, the next spell you cast is automatically maximized or extended (your choice) without increasing its level or casting time; %2 times per day (1 + Charisma modifier). (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.
Beleaguered Spellcaster	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Beleaguered Spellcaster (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Hexblade Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.564	DESC:Whenever you take damage equal to 3 x your spellcaster level (%1) from one attack, the next spell you cast is automatically maximized or extended (your choice) without increasing its level or casting time; %2 times per day (1 + Charisma modifier). (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.|3*Caster_Level_Hexblade|1+CHA
Disciple of Boccob	KEY:Hexblade ACF ~ Disciple of Boccob (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.HexbladeACF.HexbladeFamiliar	PRECLASS:1,Hexblade=4	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Hexblade Disciple of Boccob (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.565	DESC:Alternative class feature (hexblade, 4th level). A pious student of Boccob the Uncaring: you qualify for item creation feats as a character one level higher, and magic items you create are crafted at +1 caster level at no extra cost; if you destroy a permanent magic item you lose all arcane spellcasting for one day per caster level of the item. (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.
Disciple of Boccob	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Disciple of Boccob (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Hexblade Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.565	DESC:A pious student of Boccob the Uncaring: you qualify for item creation feats as a character one level higher, and magic items you create are crafted at +1 caster level at no extra cost; if you destroy a permanent magic item you lose all arcane spellcasting for one day per caster level of the item. (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.
Focus Caster	KEY:Hexblade ACF ~ Focus Caster (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.HexbladeACF.HexbladeFamiliar	PRECLASS:1,Hexblade=4	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Hexblade Focus Caster (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.569	DESC:Alternative class feature (hexblade, 4th level). Instead of a familiar you bind yourself (24-hour ritual, 100 gp) to a masterwork item that is a focus for all your spells - held, wielded or worn in addition to their normal components - and enhances one school (category below; a specialist wizard only her specialty). You are proficient with that item (not others of its kind); its hardness increases by half your caster level and its hit points by your caster level (up to double); enhancing it costs you 10%% less XP. If destroyed, you must bind another masterwork, non-magic item. Bonuses stack with Spell Focus and Spell Penetration. (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.
Focus Caster	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Focus Caster (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Hexblade Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Hexblade ACF Focus Caster|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.569	DESC:Instead of a familiar you bind yourself (24-hour ritual, 100 gp) to a masterwork item that is a focus for all your spells - held, wielded or worn in addition to their normal components - and enhances one school (category below; a specialist wizard only her specialty). You are proficient with that item (not others of its kind); its hardness increases by half your caster level and its hit points by your caster level (up to double); enhancing it costs you 10%% less XP. If destroyed, you must bind another masterwork, non-magic item. Bonuses stack with Spell Focus and Spell Penetration. (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.
Focus Caster (Abjuration)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Focus Caster (DMC) ~ Abjuration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFFocusCaster.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.569	DESC:Usually bracers, a buckler or a small shield: nonpersonal abjuration spells with one or more targets gain one additional target, affected for half the duration (full duration from 7th level); from 15th, personal abjuration spells can be cast as touch spells.
Focus Caster (Conjuration)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Focus Caster (DMC) ~ Conjuration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFFocusCaster.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.569	DESC:Usually a gnarled quarterstaff or other polearm: conjuration spells last 1 round longer (2 at 7th, 3 at 15th); concentration spells also continue that long after you stop concentrating.
Focus Caster (Divination)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Focus Caster (DMC) ~ Divination	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFFocusCaster.SpecialQuality	BONUS:CASTERLEVEL|SCHOOL.Divination|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.569	DESC:Usually a large crystal or an ornate holy symbol: +1 caster level for divination spells (applied); from 7th level divination durations double; from 15th a bonus to resist divinations equal to 1 + Intelligence modifier (minimum +1).
Focus Caster (Enchantment)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Focus Caster (DMC) ~ Enchantment	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFFocusCaster.SpecialQuality	BONUS:DC|SCHOOL.Enchantment|2|PREVARGTEQ:Caster_Level_Hexblade,15	SOURCEPAGE:p.569	DESC:Usually an ornate, nonfunctional piece of clothing (sash, hair ribbon): enchantment spells last 1 round longer (2 at 7th); concentration spells also continue that long after you stop; from 15th level +2 to the DC of your enchantment spells (applied).
Focus Caster (Evocation)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Focus Caster (DMC) ~ Evocation	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFFocusCaster.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.569	DESC:Usually a bladed weapon (longsword, dagger): +1 damage on evocation spells (a single target of multi-target spells such as magic missile); from 7th level they ignore the first 5 points of energy resistance (not immunity); from 15th, once per day, ignore a creature's immunity with an evocation spell.
Focus Caster (Illusion)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Focus Caster (DMC) ~ Illusion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFFocusCaster.SpecialQuality	BONUS:CASTERLEVEL|SCHOOL.Illusion|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.569	DESC:Usually a mask, shroud or cloak: +1 caster level for illusion spells (applied); from 7th level a bonus equal to half your caster level on caster level checks against spell resistance with illusions; from 15th, personal illusion spells can be cast as touch spells.
Focus Caster (Necromancy)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Focus Caster (DMC) ~ Necromancy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFFocusCaster.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.569	DESC:Usually a flail, kama, sickle or scythe: +25%% range for necromancy spells; from 7th level spells dealing ability damage or drain or an ability penalty deal 1 more; from 15th, living creatures failing the Fortitude save against your necromancy spells also become fatigued.
Focus Caster (Transmutation)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Focus Caster (DMC) ~ Transmutation	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFFocusCaster.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.569	DESC:Usually tools of creation (thieves' tools, a musical instrument, artisan's tools): nonpersonal transmutation spells with one or more targets gain one additional target for half the duration (full duration from 7th level); from 15th, once per day, a transmutation spell granting an ability bonus doubles it.
Impromptu Metamagic	KEY:Hexblade ACF ~ Impromptu Metamagic (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.HexbladeACF.HexbladeFamiliar	PRECLASS:1,Hexblade=4	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Hexblade Impromptu Metamagic (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.572	DESC:Alternative class feature (hexblade, 4th level). Each day choose one metamagic feat you have: you can apply it spontaneously as you cast, without increasing the spell level or casting time, (5 - the feat's level adjustment) times that day (Quicken Spell once, Silent Spell four times); you may use no other metamagic feat that day, and you must still be able to cast spells of the level the spell would have with the feat. Prepared casters need not prepare the metamagic version. (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.
Impromptu Metamagic	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Impromptu Metamagic (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Hexblade Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.572	DESC:Each day choose one metamagic feat you have: you can apply it spontaneously as you cast, without increasing the spell level or casting time, (5 - the feat's level adjustment) times that day (Quicken Spell once, Silent Spell four times); you may use no other metamagic feat that day, and you must still be able to cast spells of the level the spell would have with the feat. Prepared casters need not prepare the metamagic version. (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.
School Mastery	KEY:Hexblade ACF ~ School Mastery (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.HexbladeACF.HexbladeFamiliar	PRECLASS:1,Hexblade=4	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Hexblade School Mastery (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.576	DESC:Alternative class feature (hexblade, 4th level). Choose a school of magic (category below; a specialist wizard only her specialty): you cast its spells at +1 caster level and gain that school's benefit. (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.
School Mastery	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade School Mastery (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Hexblade Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Hexblade ACF School Mastery|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.576	DESC:Choose a school of magic (category below; a specialist wizard only her specialty): you cast its spells at +1 caster level and gain that school's benefit. (Also for hexblades and wizards, at 1st level.) Replaces the familiar.
School Mastery (Abjuration)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade School Mastery (DMC) ~ Abjuration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFSchoolMastery.SpecialQuality	BONUS:CASTERLEVEL|SCHOOL.Abjuration|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.576	DESC:Mastery of abjuration: +1 caster level for spells of this school (applied). Any non-instantaneous, nonpermanent abjuration spell you cast on someone other than yourself that does not require concentration has double the duration (not combined with other duration changes such as Extend Spell).
School Mastery (Conjuration)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade School Mastery (DMC) ~ Conjuration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFSchoolMastery.SpecialQuality	BONUS:CASTERLEVEL|SCHOOL.Conjuration|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.576	DESC:Mastery of conjuration: +1 caster level for spells of this school (applied). Each creature you conjure with any summon spell gains a +2 enhancement bonus to Dexterity and Wisdom for the spell's duration.
School Mastery (Divination)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade School Mastery (DMC) ~ Divination	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFSchoolMastery.SpecialQuality	BONUS:CASTERLEVEL|SCHOOL.Divination|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.576	DESC:Mastery of divination: +1 caster level for spells of this school (applied). Whenever you cast a divination spell you gain a +2 insight bonus on Listen and Spot checks for 1 hour per spell level (30 minutes for 0-level spells).
School Mastery (Enchantment)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade School Mastery (DMC) ~ Enchantment	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFSchoolMastery.SpecialQuality	BONUS:CASTERLEVEL|SCHOOL.Enchantment|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.576	DESC:Mastery of enchantment: +1 caster level for spells of this school (applied). For 24 hours after an enchantment spell you cast expires, its target takes -2 on Will saves against your spells and spell-like abilities (one creature at a time).
School Mastery (Evocation)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade School Mastery (DMC) ~ Evocation	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFSchoolMastery.SpecialQuality	BONUS:CASTERLEVEL|SCHOOL.Evocation|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.576	DESC:Mastery of evocation: +1 caster level for spells of this school (applied). Evocation spells you cast that deal hit point damage deal +1 point of damage.
School Mastery (Illusion)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade School Mastery (DMC) ~ Illusion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFSchoolMastery.SpecialQuality	BONUS:CASTERLEVEL|SCHOOL.Illusion|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.576	DESC:Mastery of illusion: +1 caster level for spells of this school (applied). Your illusion (shadow) spells creating partially real effects are 10%% more real (shadow conjuration creatures 30%% as strong instead of 20%%).
School Mastery (Necromancy)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade School Mastery (DMC) ~ Necromancy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFSchoolMastery.SpecialQuality	BONUS:CASTERLEVEL|SCHOOL.Necromancy|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.576	DESC:Mastery of necromancy: +1 caster level for spells of this school (applied). Undead you create with any evil spell gain temporary hit points equal to your caster level, lasting until lost.
School Mastery (Transmutation)	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade School Mastery (DMC) ~ Transmutation	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:HexbladeACFSchoolMastery.SpecialQuality	BONUS:CASTERLEVEL|SCHOOL.Transmutation|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.576	DESC:Mastery of transmutation: +1 caster level for spells of this school (applied). The DC to resist your spells that alter a creature's form, kind or type increases by +1.
Dead Levels	KEY:Hexblade ACF ~ Dead Levels (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.HexbladeACF.HexbladeDeadLevels	PRECLASS:1,Hexblade=6	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Hexblade Dead Levels (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.306	DESC:Alternative class feature (hexblade, 6th level). Forced Omens (Ex): a foreboding sense of doom travels with the hexblade (candles flicker, food turns green). From 6th level prestidigitation is a bonus spell known as a 1st-level hexblade spell (applied; if already known, another 1st-level spell instead; it cannot be traded); from 8th it can be cast as if silent without a higher slot; from 11th as a spell-like ability without verbal or somatic components, still using spell slots; from 14th 3 + Charisma modifier additional times per day; from 18th at will (applied as a spell-like ability), and it leaves his spells known (by hand). Replaces nothing.
Dead Levels	KEY:ACF ~ Hexblade Dead Levels (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Hexblade Class Feature	SPELLLEVEL:CLASS|Hexblade=1|Prestidigitation	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Hexblade=1|Prestidigitation	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=ATWILL|CASTERLEVEL=Caster_Level_Hexblade|Prestidigitation|PREVARGTEQ:HexbladeLVL,18	SOURCEPAGE:p.306	DESC:Forced Omens (Ex): a foreboding sense of doom travels with the hexblade (candles flicker, food turns green). From 6th level prestidigitation is a bonus spell known as a 1st-level hexblade spell (applied; if already known, another 1st-level spell instead; it cannot be traded); from 8th it can be cast as if silent without a higher slot; from 11th as a spell-like ability without verbal or somatic components, still using spell slots; from 14th 3 + Charisma modifier additional times per day; from 18th at will (applied as a spell-like ability), and it leaves his spells known (by hand). Replaces nothing.
